    given-names: Tengfei
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-16
repository-code: "https://github.com/TfWang1999/tumor-immune-sn2"
url: "https://github.com/TfWang1999/tumor-immune-sn2/tree/v1.0.0"
abstract: "Standalone plotting and numerical-generation routines for five main figures and Table 1 of a tumour–immune–dendritic-cell multistability study. Includes scalar equilibrium and SN2 calculations, shooting/Floquet analysis, two AUTO07p parameter planes, selected time series, and supplied figure source data."
keywords:
  - tumour-immune dynamics
  - dendritic cells
  - bifurcation
  - multistability
  - reproducibility
